. Mechanisms and associations do not establish a personal clinical effect.","direction":"Context-dependent","context":"Species, strain, preparation, dose, study population and baseline health can change applicability.","limitation":"Use liver measurements and clinical context. No direct genotype-to-microbe interaction, supplement, or individual dietary response is established in this catalogue.","contradictionStatus":"not-systematically-reviewed","contradictions":[]}'::jsonb),('biology-2026-10-18.1','host:rs58542926','rs58542926','host:rs58542926','association','limited-human','context-only','{"claim":"This common C/T marker is associated with hepatic fat and lipid traits. Liver-fat susceptibility and circulating lipid levels need separate interpretation.","humanRelevance":"Research context. Mechanisms and associations do not establish a personal clinical effect.","direction":"Context-dependent","context":"Species, strain, preparation, dose, study population and baseline health can change applicability.","limitation":"Do not infer liver health from cholesterol alone. Actual laboratory results and clinical liver assessment take priority; no genetic supplement or food prescription is made.","contradictionStatus":"not-systematically-reviewed","contradictions":[]}'::jsonb),('biology-2026-10-18.1','host:rs1260326','rs1260326','host:rs1260326','association','limited-human','context-only','{"claim":"This common C/T marker is associated with triglyceride and fasting-glucose traits, which can move in different directions. It does not diagnose insulin resistance or a need to restrict a food group.","humanRelevance":"Research context. Mechanisms and associations do not establish a personal clinical effect.","direction":"Context-dependent","context":"Species, strain, preparation, dose, study population and baseline health can change applicability.","limitation":"Review measured triglycerides, glucose and HbA1c together. No genotype-specific carbohydrate dose or microbial effect is inferred.","contradictionStatus":"not-systematically-reviewed","contradictions":[]}'::jsonb),('biology-2026-10-18.1','host:rs1801133','rs1801133','host:rs1801133','association','limited-human','context-only','{"claim":"The forward-strand A allele corresponds to gene-oriented 677T. This common variant can influence folate-related biomarkers; it does not diagnose a deficiency.","humanRelevance":"Research context. Mechanisms and associations do not establish a personal clinical effect.","direction":"Context-dependent","context":"Species, strain, preparation, dose, study population and baseline health can change applicability.","limitation":"No genetic supplement prescription. Assess actual intake and relevant laboratory findings.","contradictionStatus":"not-systematically-reviewed","contradictions":[]}'::jsonb),('biology-2026-10-18.1','host:rs4988235','rs4988235','host:rs4988235','association','limited-human','context-only','{"claim":"Forward-strand A corresponds to the -13910T persistence-associated allele in studied populations. GG is compatible with non-persistence at this marker, not a diagnosis of intolerance.","humanRelevance":"Research context. Mechanisms and associations do not establish a personal clinical effect.","direction":"Context-dependent","context":"Species, strain, preparation, dose, study population and baseline health can change applicability.","limitation":"Other persistence variants occur across ancestries. Do not exclude dairy solely from this call; use tolerance observations.","contradictionStatus":"not-systematically-reviewed","contradictions":[]}'::jsonb),('biology-2026-10-18.1','host:rs174547','rs174547','host:rs174547','association','limited-human','context-only','{"claim":"This C/T marker is associated with fatty-acid profiles and inferred desaturase activity in studied populations. Effects vary with ancestry and diet.","humanRelevance":"Research context. Mechanisms and associations do not establish a personal clinical effect.","directi